Production schema migrations

Create a revision:
    DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://... alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

Apply:
    DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://... alembic upgrade head

Rollback is never automatic in production. Review generated SQL in CI and back up before
any destructive migration. Deploy schema-compatible application code before migrations
that remove or rename fields. The app does not call create_all against PostgreSQL.
